  "description": "Connects the OASIS to TRON -- high-throughput blockchain optimised for entertainment and gaming with 2,000+ TPS, minimal fees, and TRC-20/TRC-721 support. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
